From 9654d6000047f8335d6a760c067bf93050a3dda0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:50:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 232/245] Batch A: verified audit hardening fixes (S1-S7,
 P1-P2) + Warden firewall re-arm

Security (all trigger states confirmed reachable per reachability rule):
 S1 httpd/web.c:9099-9100  format-string: snprintf(...,ver/target) -> "%s"
 S2 rc/vpnc_fusion.c       NordVPN/HMA region/conntype: charset guard before
                           system() (single-quote breakout injection)
 S3 rc/wireguard.c:250     route line -> system(): shell-metachar filter
                           (twin of rc_ipsec.c)
 S4 httpd/httpd.c:1583     OOB read: len>=3 guard before file[len-3] compare
 S5 httpd/web.c:24368      do_page_default open redirect: xss/useful + reject
                           scheme://, //, backslash -> fall back to index.asp
 S6 gkd/gkd.c:217          d_name -> popen(): charset guard (rmcpd-strict)
 S7 rc/gatekeeper.c        generated apply.sh: reject bad lan_ifname/lan_ipaddr
                           before they splice unquoted into root iptables rules

Perf:
 P1 httpd/reaper_inject.c  reaper-native pages (GK/Diag/Wireless/Warden) get the
                           bounce WITHOUT reaper_content.css that fought their own
                           chrome; 3-valued inject, byte-identical stock block.
                           Reaper_Warden moved skip[] -> native[] (no self-bounce).
 P2 www/Reaper_Traffic.asp drop redundant 2nd getJSON('live') per 30s cycle;
                           renderQuota() extracted, one live fetch/cycle.

rc/firewall.c: re-run /tmp/rwarden/apply.sh after every firewall rebuild
 (mirrors the gk_enable hook) - survives restart_firewall + arms Warden once
 the LAN bridge is up on cold boot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
